&lt;h2&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Logistics Tribe builds the systems powering end-to-end delivery across North America, Europe and Australia/New Zealand: getting fresh ingredients into our facilities, giving customers the best delivery options the network can support, and tracking every box to the customer&#39;s door. Today it is a single engineering team - two staff engineers, a data engineer and seven mid-to-senior engineers - led by the Director of Engineering, owning that software and keeping it running in production. You will join as an Engineering Manager and take line management of the seven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The work is operations-heavy and business-critical, spread across different subdomains. You won&#39;t own a fixed backlog in one corner of the domain; the team&#39;s scope follows where the business pressure is. That is reflected in how we work: rather than one fixed squad, the team organises into small, project-focused pods that form and dissolve as projects start and finish. In a typical sprint, your engineers might be spread across three projects with three different product managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategy and technical direction are things we shape together - staff engineers, product managers and you all contributing, nobody working from a script handed down. You own the people and the delivery of your engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports to the Director of Engineering for Logistics Tech; your team is spread across two geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of mid-to-senior engineers: set clear expectations, give regular and honest feedback, and own their development - including building the case when someone is ready for the next level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the people and stay technical. This role carries real hands-on expectations - you still deliver code yourself, not management at a distance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep raising the team&#39;s AI bar: role-model it in your own work, and push the workflows where AI genuinely changes how fast we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make our project-based way of working work for people. You lead project staffing with the Director of Engineering and the product managers, putting engineers where the work and their growth both fit. You limit how many projects anyone carries, and you keep handovers clean so nobody becomes a single point of failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery health of your team&#39;s work together with the product managers and the engineers leading each project: realistic plans, sound quality, and systems that stay reliable once shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and onboard well - you&#39;ll be building the team&#39;s balance of skills as projects and domains shift under you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the engineering practices we care about: behaviour-driven tests for every business use case, and small iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape tribe culture as part of the leadership team, in a setup that is deliberately flat and collaborative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years leading mid-to-senior engineers in an agile environment, backed by 6+ years of total engineering experience - you&#39;ve run development and growth conversations and seen people through to promotion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading people through changing project boundaries - this is a team that reforms around projects, not one that sits still.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A backend-leaning technical grounding - event-driven microservices, Kubernetes, Kafka, relational databases, CI/CD - with real BDD/TDD habits that make large refactorings safe. You don&#39;t need to be the deepest engineer in the room, but you need to earn the team&#39;s respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, practical experience building with AI tooling: you&#39;ve shipped real work with it, you know where it fails, and you learn as readily from others as they learn from you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-oriented mindset: you can reason about the business problem, prioritise for customer impact, and push back on low-value scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in physical-world and supply-chain problems. You want to understand how the operation actually works; logistics or carrier integration experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don&#39;t &quot;tick all the boxes&quot; but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-communications-tribe&quot;&gt;The Communications Tribe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Communications Tribe is part of HelloFresh&#39;s Growth Alliance. Our mission is to enable a highly personalised, automated CRM communication ecosystem that prioritises user-centric engagement across our owned channels: email, push, SMS, in-app and embedded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The problems we are solving:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How anyone with a good reason to speak to customers can do it safely and in minutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How we make sure every customer gets the right message, at the right moment, through the right channel, so that our communication is truly personal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How we move to an autonomous, self-optimising system that continuously learns from every past interaction and gets better with each send.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How we make sure we can reach our customers in their preferred channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to decentralise how HelloFresh talks to people across the whole relationship with us: prospects, subscribers and those who have left. Setting up and steering communications stops being the job of a small group of specialists and becomes something teams across the business can do safely, on top of tools and an intelligence layer that we build and that learn from every send. That loop reaches beyond CRM, so the customer experience is coherent from the first ad someone sees to the communication that converts and retains them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Engineering, Communications, you will lead the engineering organisation that makes this real. You will set technical direction, hold the bar for reliability and operational excellence, and partner with Product, Marketing and CRM teams to turn the vision into working systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Communications engineering organisation through a layer of Engineering Leads and Staff Engineers, across Berlin and Warsaw.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy for an autonomous, self-optimising communication system that learns from every interaction, and turn it into reality together with Product, Marketing and CRM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the move to true personalisation, so that every person we talk to gets the right message, at the right moment, through the right channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build platforms that let teams across the business create and steer communications safely and on their own, inside clear guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reliability and operational excellence of every system we run: SLOs, monitoring and alerting, incident management and on-call maturity, so that problems are caught before anyone downstream notices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand our reach into new channels, from early experiments to scaled solutions, based on how people actually want to hear from us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our transformation into a GenAI-native engineering organisation, from AI-assisted development to agentic workflows embedded in everyday operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and develop Engineering Leads and Staff Engineers, holding them accountable for team health, delivery and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate organisational change with maturity, keeping teams focused and motivated as priorities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-bring&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven leadership at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in software engineering, with 4+ years managing Engineering Managers or Leads. You have led teams across multiple offices and built trust without daily co-location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep technical credibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You can set direction for large-scale backend, data and event-driven systems, and you understand how applied machine learning and automated decisioning behave in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of building self-service platforms that enable non-engineers to work safely and quickly, including the governance and guardrails that make that possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have built or scaled AI-native engineering practices and AI-driven products, not just adopted AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grounding in SRE practices: SLOs and SLIs, observability, incident management and on-call culture for systems that directly touch customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer communication or personalisation domain fluency&lt;/strong&gt;, or a strong aptitude to build it quickly. Experience with CRM, messaging, customer data or personalisation systems, and with measuring impact through experimentation, is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; You work comfortably with Product, Marketing and CRM teams, and translate business outcomes into engineering priorities and back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt;, from engineers to senior business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low ego, high ownership, and a bias toward clarity over complexity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;nice-to-have&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking a newly modernised platform from rollout to stable, self-service operation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling AI agents that make customer-facing decisions, with impact measured against a control group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with consent, privacy and deliverability requirements for customer communication across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in subscription, e-commerce or consumer businesses operating in many markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience introducing new messaging channels, including conversational ones.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a discount on HelloFresh meal kits, delivered straight to your door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build for the long-term with our company pension scheme (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounted memberships with Urban Sports Club and John Reed, yoga classes, and access to Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your work and life with flexible hours, Work From Home/Abroad options, and a home office setup budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive childcare support (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a monthly allowance for the Deutschlandticket to support sustainable commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with access to internal trainings and a central L&amp;amp;D budget (remove for interns).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from a modern, comfortable office in Berlin-Kreuzberg and enjoy social events like team outings, Friday beers, and company runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-ldoc-pending=&quot;&quot; data-intent=&quot;What we offer and how we work&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Software Engineer (All Genders) to serve as the technical face of Minerva Frontline to our internal hardware teams, pilot customers, and program partners. In this role, you will bring Frontline into new internal and customer projects, take ownership of technical integration, and build trust through technical excellence rather than project management. We support each other as a team and work closely across disciplines to achieve our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When something fails in the field, you will be on-site to diagnose and resolve the issue under time pressure, working directly alongside the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of software, hardware, and operational reality: setting up the C++ backend that orchestrates UAV swarms, integrating new platforms into live systems, and ensuring command-and-control processes function seamlessly in isolated, bandwidth-constrained tactical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, configure, and commission Minerva Frontline in customer operational environments, working with edge hardware, restricted networks, and tactical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate new UAV platforms and features into the Frontline platform, serving as the technical on-site lead for complex system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and resolve real-time problems including swarm telemetry degradation, gRPC connectivity issues, and MAVLink command translation errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate feedback from operators, pilots, and customers into concrete technical requirements, collaborating closely with engineering teams to implement improvements and platform integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight tests and trial campaigns to validate that software commands are reliably and accurately executed by physical drones under field conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop custom tooling, scripts, diagnostic tools, and test environments to make deployments reproducible, efficient, and robust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with hardware engineers, drone platforms, and test equipment on regular deployments to customer sites and test grounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Robotics, Systems Engineering, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in modern C++ (C++17/20/23) with proven experience reading, debugging, and customizing production C++ codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building, deploying, and operating complex real-time distributed systems using technologies such as gRPC, Flatbuffers, WebSockets, MAVLink, or MAVSDK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of deploying software solutions to external customers and collaborating with hardware teams during flight tests and platform integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly within Germany (up to 40%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ROS / ROS 2, PX4, ArduPilot, or autonomous robotics systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in the defence sector, aerospace, or with military unmanned systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with containerization and CI/CD tools tailored for edge devices (Docker, Podman, Yocto, embedded Linux, systemd).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tactical mesh networking, RF communications, or bandwidth-constrained radio link protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active German / NATO security clearance or prior experience working in security-cleared environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
