&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Stark, our embedded engineering team is responsible for bridging cutting-edge autonomy with resilient, real-world execution. We design and deliver the embedded control architecture, sensor integration, and secure communications backbones that keep our platforms connected, responsive, and safe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Embedded Software Engineer with strong low-level C/C++ skills and practical experience integrating software, electronics, and communications in embedded control systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
