&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our cloud engineering team builds and maintains the foundational infrastructure supporting next-generation defence technology. We collaborate closely with software, autonomy, and security engineers to deliver high-availability systems across air, land, and sea domains. We foster an agile, fast-paced environment where IaC, automation, and operational excellence drive our core engineering practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
